  "correct_answer": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is divisible by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> are non-real cube&nbsp;roots of units</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp; from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
